<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέοικα</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be like, suit,</i> c. dat. pers., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅς τις οἷ τ᾽ ἐπέοικε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.392
				</span></i>
			: elsewh. impers., <i>it is fit, proper,</i> c. dat. pers.
			et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφῶϊν μέν τ᾽ ἐπέοικε . . ἑστάμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					4.341
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝέῳ δέ τε πάντ᾽ ἐπέοικε . .
				κεῖσθαι</span> '<i>tis a seemly thing</i> for a young man
			to lie dead, <i><span class="en">
				22.71
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				7.95
			</span></i>: c. acc. pers. et inf., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαοὺς δ᾽ οὐκ ἐπέοικε . . ταῦτ᾽
					ἐπαγείρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.126
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅν τ᾽ ἐπέοικε βουλὰς βουλεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.146
				</span></i>
			: with inf. understood, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδάσσομαι ὅσσ᾽ ἐπέοικε [ἀποδάσασθαι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				24.595
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτ᾽ οὖν ἐσθῆτος δευήσεαι
				οὔτε τευ ἄλλου, ὧν ἐπέοιχ᾽ ἱκέτην . . ἀντιάσαντα
				[μὴ δεύεσθαι</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.193
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			part. pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεικότα</span>
			<i>seemly, fit,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					669
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ichn.</u>
				271
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>resemble,</i> c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.12.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.7.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀριθμῷ πάντ᾽ ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pythag.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				4.2
			</span></i>.</div>
